  "body": "Bring me an offer! \r\n\r\nTake a chance here and you might just land an early Christmas present. \r\n\r\nLet’s cut straight to the chase: This is officially your lowest-priced entry point into a two room property in Takapuna. \r\n\r\nFurnished, vacant and ready for a new owner. \r\n\r\nLocated in the highly sought-after Shoalhaven complex at 130 Anzac Street, the instructions here are absolute, this apartment will be sold. The vendor is moving on, creating an unprecedented opportunity for first-home buyers, downsizers, or savvy investors to steal the deal of the year.\r\n\r\nWhy this is the best buy on the Shore:\r\n\r\nUnbeatable Affordability: You will not find a cheaper 2 room option in the suburb.\r\n\r\nResort-Style Living: You get exclusive access to a swimming pool, a fully equipped fitness center, and a relaxed, community-first vibe that feels like a permanent vacation.\r\n\r\nPrime Location: Just a short, flat stroll into the vibrant heart of Takapuna’s shops, cafes, and beach, plus you're fully zoned for top-tier local schools.\r\n\r\nStress-Free Parking: Tons of visitor parking makes hosting friends and family an absolute breeze.\r\n\r\nYou don’t need a millionaire’s budget to secure a piece of Takapuna real estate, but you do need to act fast.\r\n\r\nGet in touch today to secure your viewing before it’s gone!\r\n\r\nNote: The photos used are of a similar unit in the same complex; however, please note that the furniture, outlook, and finishes may vary. For more specific details, please refer to the chattels list.\r\n\r\nWhile some tenants and owners may use the flexi room as a bedroom, it is not legally consented to be one.",
